r></mtable></menclose></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">j</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">k</mi></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, a normal vector to the plane is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"11\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D427 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c27E8\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c27E9\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">n</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
